    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/282db283741fdd1864f6515629598aee.poster.avif?t=1754552243\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/282db283741fdd1864f6515629598aee.webm?t=1754552243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/282db283741fdd1864f6515629598aee.mp4?t=1754552243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Rise Again is an action RPG that combines elements of wizardry, roguelike gameplay, and dungeon crawling. Hack and slash your way through enemies in a medieval fantasy universe, transforming from a forgetful wizard into a skilled dungeon crawler as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spellbinding Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you delivered the final blow, you fell victim to the Lich's curse. You can't remember anything before the curse. As you open your eyes, you find yourself in a mysterious realm with a Portal that resurrects the dead. Explore the new realm, uncover the truth behind resurrection,  and overcome the challenges of this realm alongside others cursed like you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/e0cbcfad1ecf9b205218e90a767db185.poster.avif?t=1754552243\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/e0cbcfad1ecf9b205218e90a767db185.webm?t=1754552243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/e0cbcfad1ecf9b205218e90a767db185.mp4?t=1754552243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Art of Combat...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the ever-changing dungeons to break free from the Lich's Curse, defeat the summoned creatures. Discover numerous spells and enhancements throughout your adventure. Experience unique battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/81a6bae9c9acca6d193e3b4e0a1c097f.poster.avif?t=1754552243\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/81a6bae9c9acca6d193e3b4e0a1c097f.webm?t=1754552243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are you ready to Rise Again?</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/282db283741fdd1864f6515629598aee.poster.avif?t=1754552243\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/282db283741fdd1864f6515629598aee.webm?t=1754552243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/282db283741fdd1864f6515629598aee.mp4?t=1754552243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Rise Again is an action RPG that combines elements of wizardry, roguelike gameplay, and dungeon crawling. Hack and slash your way through enemies in a medieval fantasy universe, transforming from a forgetful wizard into a skilled dungeon crawler as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spellbinding Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you delivered the final blow, you fell victim to the Lich's curse. You can't remember anything before the curse. As you open your eyes, you find yourself in a mysterious realm with a Portal that resurrects the dead. Explore the new realm, uncover the truth behind resurrection,  and overcome the challenges of this realm alongside others cursed like you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/e0cbcfad1ecf9b205218e90a767db185.poster.avif?t=1754552243\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/e0cbcfad1ecf9b205218e90a767db185.webm?t=1754552243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/e0cbcfad1ecf9b205218e90a767db185.mp4?t=1754552243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Art of Combat...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the ever-changing dungeons to break free from the Lich's Curse, defeat the summoned creatures. Discover numerous spells and enhancements throughout your adventure. Experience unique battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/81a6bae9c9acca6d193e3b4e0a1c097f.poster.avif?t=1754552243\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/81a6bae9c9acca6d193e3b4e0a1c097f.webm?t=1754552243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are you ready to Rise Again?</h2>",
    "short_description": "Rise Again is an Action Roguelike inspired by Hack n Slash and Dungeon Crawler. Witness the adventures of a cursed wizard in ever-changing dungeons. Kill, Die, and Rise Again to lift the curse. Every death is a step closer to freedom. Will you break the curse?",
